# UI design & styling

## 1. Visual style
- Fresh, clear, high contrast — not pastel kitsch.
- Palette: `gray-100` content, `zinc-800` chrome, `orange-700` primary/CTA, `yellow-400` accent, `zinc-950` strong text.
- Icons: only `lucide-react` with explicit size classes.
- Font: Nunito via `--font-nunito` / `font-sans` (see typography rule).

## 2. shadcn/ui
- Prefer existing shadcn primitives under `@/components/ui/`.
- Extend via `className`, do not fork base files unless required.

## 3. Tailwind
- Tailwind v4 only; no arbitrary hex in `className`.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Interactive elements: `transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out`.
- Buttons/links: `cursor-pointer`; disabled: `cursor-not-allowed`.
- Mobile-first (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`).

## 4. Forms
- Forms with Zod/server validation: `noValidate`.
- Field errors under the field in German; toast for global errors only.
- Edit dialogs: primary action only; close via X (no Abbrechen) — except delete confirms.
